<title>USA: USDA DONATES VEG OIL, RICE, BEANS,FLOUR TO GEORGIA.</title>
<headline>USDA DONATES VEG OIL, RICE, BEANS,FLOUR TO GEORGIA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Tuesday it would donate about 3,750 tonnes of commodities, including vegetable oil, rice, beans and flour to a private charity to distribute in Georgia.</p>
<p>The donation will be made under USDA's Food for Progress program. The supply period is fiscal year 1997.</p>
